# =============================================================================
# terraform/.gitignore
#
# WHY GITIGNORE FOR TERRAFORM?
#   Several Terraform files must NEVER be committed to git:
#
#   .terraform/            — Downloaded provider binaries (~300 MB of Go binaries)
#                            Re-downloaded by `terraform init` from the lock file
#   terraform.tfstate      — Contains ALL resource IDs, IP addresses, SA keys,
#                            and sometimes plaintext secrets (e.g. DB passwords)
#                            Using remote state (GCS) means this should never
#                            exist locally. If it does, it's a security risk.
#   terraform.tfvars       — May contain your actual project_id, region, or any
#                            variable overrides. Commit tfvars.example instead.
#   *.tfplan               — Plan files contain the same sensitive info as tfstate
#   crash.log              — Terraform crash reports may contain state fragments
# =============================================================================

# ── Terraform Core ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl     # Commit this if you want reproducible provider versions
                        # Uncomment the line below to gitignore it instead
# .terraform.lock.hcl

# ── State Files (use remote GCS backend instead) ──────────────────────────────
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.backup
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# ── Variable Files (may contain project IDs, secrets) ────────────────────────
terraform.tfvars
terraform.tfvars.json
*.auto.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars.json

# ── Plan Files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.tfplan
*.plan

# ── Crash Logs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
crash.log
crash.*.log

# ── Override Files (local developer overrides) ────────────────────────────────
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# ── IDE / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp
